error[V1001]: not valid CSV: this row has 1 cells, but the header has 2
 --> datasets/cities.csv:3:1
  |
3 | "Köln,DE
  | ^^^^^^^^ here
  = help: a CSV dataset is a header row of column names, then one line per row with as many cells

error[V1006]: the column `name` is named twice
 --> datasets/towns.csv:1:1
  |
1 | name,name
  | ^^^^^^^^^ in this header
  = help: give every column of a CSV dataset its own name
